  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/460915.svg\" alt=\"標題\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>屬於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Expansion Collection</a> 的模組&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過實作全新風格的細節，改善遊戲環境體驗</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>已實作功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">紫頌植物（及花朵）&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- 實作了來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Better End</strong></a> 的優化版紫頌植物（此非原版，僅為重新實作版本）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Vanilla Expansion/better nature/screen3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"248\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">火把花</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;- 為火把花的花朵區塊新增發光效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Vanilla Expansion/better nature/screen4.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"312\" height=\"239\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>規劃中功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">樹葉會自然腐爛嗎？更精緻的草方塊模型？隱藏彩蛋？&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;免責聲明： </strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong><strong>所有舊版本檔案現已歸檔</strong></strong></span></p>",
